+# Wire Format
+
+This project's documentation and source tree contain no recorded decision establishing a specific wire serialisation format as the project's standard; the codebase instead offers multiple interchangeable serialisation options (including JSON, XML, msgpack, protobuf, TOML, YAML, and BSON) via its `binding` and `render` packages without designating one as authoritative, so nothing is currently recorded.
